/P 213 0 R
/E (InventAI delivers a practical, modular, web-based inventory forecasting and optimization system tailored specifically for small and medium retail businesses operating with limited budgets and resources. Rather than leaving stocking choices to manual tracking, spreadsheets, or rule-of-thumb intuition, the system connects sales data entry, data cleaning, and feature engineering directly with demand forecasting and inventory decision logic. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
