397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Forecasted demand drives safety stock, reorder point, and order quantity calculations while classifying each stock keeping unit into Healthy, Low Stock, or Overstocked states to support restocking and markdown or clearance decisions. Across the comparative evaluation of ARIMA, XGBoost, and LSTM on retail sales data, XGBoost delivered superior forecasting accuracy and practical execution speed, making it well suited for production use alongside an interactive React.js dashboard and role-based alerts. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Compared with legacy point-of-sale tools, costly enterprise resource planning suites, passive RFID or IoT visibility setups, and complex reinforcement learning approaches, InventAI achieves forecasting and operational visibility at a sustainable deployment cost. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Looking ahead, the modular architecture provides a clear foundation for incorporating additional exogenous signals, expanding dashboard analytics, moving toward real-time streaming processing, exploring reinforcement learning policies, and scaling to cloud deployment with role-based authentication.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
